<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fear</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Necromancer (guild level 19), Dark Knight (guild level 28)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast fear &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast fear</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>Fills the target's mind with terror. While the fear lasts, every half minute 
in a fight there is a chance they believe they are about to die and flee. 
The better your spell, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to several 
minutes.
</p><p>It works on humanoids and mammals only. The target resists with their mind, 
and the spell may fail; either way, casting it starts a fight. The calm spell 
takes the fear away again. You must be standing. It is also found on potions, 
wands, scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Panic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Calm</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Shield</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>